   'description': '**Use DNeasy PowerSoil Pro Kit and always wear gloves when working with DNA**\n\n1. Preheat Water for molecular biology/C6 at 60°C\n2. Centrifuge empty bead tubes for 30 sec\n3. Remove liquid from chips with cannula and syringe and place in bead tube   -> Liquid or Chips?\n4. Remove MESIF from housing with scalpel and tweezers, place in bead tube\n5. Add 800 µL of CD1, press MESIF with tweezers for 1 minute in CD1, incubate at 65 °C für 10 min\n6. Bead beat 2x 1 min at 5 m/s  with rest inbetween\n7. Centrifuge the bead tube for 1 min at 15000 g, transfer liquid from centrifugation to new clean tube\n8. Centifuge MESIF for 5 min at 15000 g to remove all liquid, transfer liquid from centrifugation to tube\n9. Add 200 µL of CD2, vortex 5 sec\n10. Centrifuge for 1 min at 15000 g, transfer up to 700 µL to new tube\n11. Add 600 µL of CD3, vortex 5 sec\n12. Load 650 µL of lysate to spin column, centrifuge 1 min at 15000 g, repeat with remaining lysate, new collection tube\n13. Add 500 µL EA, centrifuge 1 min at 15000 g, new collection tube\n14. Add 500 µL C5, cetrifuge 1 min at  15000 g, new collection tube\n15. Centrifuge 2 min at 16000 g, place in elution tube\n16. Add 100 µL C6 or Water for eltution, centrifuge 1 min at 15000 g\n17. Measure DNA concentration with Nanodrop and Qubit',
   'extras': [{'key': 'Short name', 'type': 'str', 'value': 'DNA extraction'},
    {'key': 'Full name', 'type': 'str', 'value': 'DNA extraction'}],
   'id': 16916,
   'identifier': 'dna-extraction',
   'last_modified': '2023-06-12T11:00:04.530094+00:00',
   'license': None,
   'plain_description': 'Use DNeasy PowerSoil Pro Kit and always wear gloves when working with DNA Preheat Water for molecular biology/C6 at 60°C Centrifuge empty bead tubes for 30 sec Remove liquid from chips with cannula and syringe and place in bead tube -> Liquid or Chips? Remove MESIF from housing with scalpel and tweezers, place in bead tube Add 800 µL of CD1, press MESIF with tweezers for 1 minute in CD1, incubate at 65 °C für 10 min Bead beat 2x 1 min at 5 m/s with rest inbetween Centrifuge the bead tube for 1 min at 15000 g, transfer liquid from centrifugation to new clean tube Centifuge MESIF for 5 min at 15000 g to remove all liquid, transfer liquid from centrifugation to tube Add 200 µL of CD2, vortex 5 sec Centrifuge for 1 min at 15000 g, transfer up to 700 µL to new tube Add 600 µL of CD3, vortex 5 sec Load 650 µL of lysate to spin column, centrifuge 1 min at 15000 g, repeat with remaining lysate, new collection tube Add 500 µL EA, centrifuge 1 min at 15000 g, new collection tube Add 500 µL C5, cetrifuge 1 min at 15000 g, new collection tube Centrifuge 2 min at 16000 g, place in elution tube Add 100 µL C6 or Water for eltution, centrifuge 1 min at 15000 g Measure DNA concentration with Nanodrop and Qubit',
   'state': 'active',
