   'description': '**Work in a PCR hood, wear gloves**\n\n1. Dilute DNA templates in PCR stripes in 10 µL total volume to 2 ng/µL (equals 20 ng DNA) in water\n2. Pipette mastermix together, mix thoroughly, add Q5 polymerase, pipette up and down to remove streaks\n3. Add 15 µL Mastermix, vortex shortly and centrifuge liquid to bottom of tube\n4. PCR with touchdown (56-52 °C), PCR1, Amhed, Amplicon\n\n5. Agarose Gelelectrophoresis with a 1 % Agarose gel in 0.5x TAE Buffer+ SybrSafe\n6. 5 µL PCR sample + 1 µL Loading Dye, 3 µKL Marker, 120 V for 30 min\n\n7. DNA Clean & Concentratior -25 from Zymo Research, **always war gloves**\n8. Heat elution buffer to 60 - 70 °C (water)\n9. 100 µL Binding Buffer + 20 µL Sample (5:1), vortex, add to spin column, centrifuge 30 sec at 10-16000 g\n10. Wash 2 x with 200 µL Wash Buffer, centrifuge 30 sec at 10-16000 g\n11. Elute with 30 µL, incubate 1 min before centrifugation for 30 sec at 10-16000 g\n12. Measure DNA concentration with Qubit',
   'extras': [{'key': 'Full name',
     'type': 'str',
     'value': 'Amplicon sequencing'},
    {'key': 'Short name', 'type': 'str', 'value': 'Amplicon sequencing'}],
   'id': 17342,
   'identifier': 'amplicon-sequencing',
   'last_modified': '2023-06-12T11:00:04.381610+00:00',
   'license': None,
   'plain_description': 'Work in a PCR hood, wear gloves Dilute DNA templates in PCR stripes in 10 µL total volume to 2 ng/µL (equals 20 ng DNA) in water Pipette mastermix together, mix thoroughly, add Q5 polymerase, pipette up and down to remove streaks Add 15 µL Mastermix, vortex shortly and centrifuge liquid to bottom of tube PCR with touchdown (56-52 °C), PCR1, Amhed, Amplicon Agarose Gelelectrophoresis with a 1 % Agarose gel in 0.5x TAE Buffer+ SybrSafe 5 µL PCR sample + 1 µL Loading Dye, 3 µKL Marker, 120 V for 30 min DNA Clean & Concentratior -25 from Zymo Research, always war gloves Heat elution buffer to 60 - 70 °C (water) 100 µL Binding Buffer + 20 µL Sample (5:1), vortex, add to spin column, centrifuge 30 sec at 10-16000 g Wash 2 x with 200 µL Wash Buffer, centrifuge 30 sec at 10-16000 g Elute with 30 µL, incubate 1 min before centrifugation for 30 sec at 10-16000 g Measure DNA concentration with Qubit',
   'state': 'active',
   'tags': [],
   'title': 'Amplicon sequencing',
   'type': 'protocol',
   'visibility': 'public'},
